    {
      "t": "Marinate the chicken",
      "x": "Whisk the 25 g yogurt, 15 g lemon juice, 15 ml olive oil, 10 g salt and all the chicken spices into a paste. Toss the thighs to coat. Marinate 30 min in the fridge if you have time, otherwise while you rinse the rice.",
      "uses": [
